" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Deliberate, free act,</text><text x=\"790\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">could have been otherwise</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"600\" width=\"740\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Later thinkers had to reconcile these</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Al-Farabi and Avicenna adapt emanation to a willing God</text></svg>",
