            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1277 Condemnation</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"180\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Etienne Tempier</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bishop of Paris</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"360\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">219 propositions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">condemned (radical Aristotelianism,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"505\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Averroism, eternity of the world)</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"590\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Consequence: forced new thinking</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">about divine freedom &amp; necessity</text></svg>",
            "caption": "The 1277 condemnation at Paris and its aftermath."
